=== Prompt for EPAM-058 (attempt 1) ===
Implement user story EPAM-058: Slash Command: /plan

## Story Description
Add `/plan` to the REPL so users can enter planning mode without leaving chat. This should reuse the existing PlanMode implementation and provide an in-session workflow for plan generation, approval, editing, and execution.

## Acceptance Criteria
- `/plan <task>` is registered in SlashCommands.ts
- `/plan` invokes PlanMode.generatePlan() from within the REPL session
- Approval, cancel, and edit flows are supported in-session
- Approved plans execute in-session with step headers and status updates
- Approved plan JSON is stored in `.epam/plans/`
- Unit tests cover slash-command registration and REPL integration with PlanMode

## Technical Notes
- files: ["src/cli/repl/SlashCommands.ts","src/cli/repl/Repl.ts","src/agent/PlanMode.ts"]
- requiredSkills: ["TypeScript","repl-integration","plan-execution"]

## Files to Create/Modify
src/cli/repl/SlashCommands.ts, src/cli/repl/Repl.ts, src/agent/PlanMode.ts

## Dependencies
EPAM-005

